://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YA9C4ssr3g8Q7kNvwEeYrM3&_nc_oc=AdpiNlLkR3ECM-Dxuo6Sv3JSe6yEZGbMEysAfSDvost7t26RRx9oVBv0amLsjcLzAxg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4kQ-v3Txyp7E2_uXcBFL4M3jN5QxoN4c-1b5mr3B78DQ&oe=69FF4DE6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OetNdfLtJPYQ7kNvwHWYlCa&_nc_oc=AdoRcYwvY0NJGfRSLiGNGPNxwdcVjYVRB10S77L9As2wr71EclHLeymiKFkvpi8SzLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7GrCq-vmA-rlu9xlmnSbLozCIEkX7TRcem0W9FdIqzcA&oe=69FF4332"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RWtzgZw-LLwQ7kNvwGgV_sO&_nc_oc=Adrqgbnug75ZHIWLJPuqOea19_hzWGVdnDwV4HdZyHez0ZB99tb8LPq9spumr8n7bTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6zmcFYaGIUtq2mbbSGCQ5nNLHEaT7GiD3ALWn9IGmn8A&oe=69FF3CFB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ybgpRGzu1xMQ7kNvwHjtQTI&_nc_oc=AdoRlw4YXLrWgelaDHvalif-Rw37k7_50RwrGUukQKE1zUCGjfAkndYjF5VcATiHpYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4_GLvACq1sq1cZnnfwMTmQdi5Ievl6VLWBcEN6-JeO_w&oe=69FF5273"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=52AtH7rPXS0Q7kNvwEF6qvE&_nc_oc=AdplyOI9mRyZE-dqpa6s9b9WuTQF74Uvf0L7SaJFQich0oeVxgHHWz6phCA02eXLGQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5SaqfR76xRP63nNNz4u4ntIxGM6gKiAGZpCHBT0unz-Q&oe=69FF5072"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s-DNkzygpnwQ7kNvwHBXEFd&_nc_oc=AdpGwuADen3MJNRyHurpKoxcOmM5uxMm-xfx12ZEKOFTteWuVP6phie7h5-u_5ff5ps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5b980Y1aC_jo3a_FZ0eIuYrwQtgDp5CiFU_qlDnNA40w&oe=69FF47D3"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hGT4gLG4XMkQ7kNvwGk6kNm&_nc_oc=AdqMsllK8QHYysgif2CS-KZ175BQlzKVNoYfZGSoVMxp8Uk8rUuWizNvgFne6dWbMfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5bA2uu2zNGBH9k_MivpHCWhbdR3gkD6W-MWAFXbsz3Yw&oe=69FF43EF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gqBpOvAHTrkQ7kNvwF-PzVH&_nc_oc=AdqIUbIiivPFLmHj5SJFPJyJOXwi0tvMJ_nKNBcoTJNq8q8mZ873MJFz34VAZH4rb_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7-D-TsIUjoWO5cUW3Xqnc-heoo5KyB3axSH0tId6DoRQ&oe=69FF4FA2"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_521808747164